<div class="sop-template">
  <div class="sop-template-label">Card-decline notice</div>
<pre>Hi {first_name},

Heads up: your card on file got declined for the {month} charge. Most
common cause is the card hit its expiration or got reissued.

Update the card on file: {stripe_portal_link}

Or send a check / ACH if that's easier — just reply and I'll send the
invoice.

No service interruption; just want to clear it up before next cycle.

— Jon</pre>
</div>

<div class="sop-template">
  <div class="sop-template-label">Polite reminder (day +3)</div>
<pre>Hi {first_name},

Friendly nudge: the {month} invoice is sitting in your inbox. Quick
