{stripe_link}

— J</pre>
</div>

<div class="sop-template">
  <div class="sop-template-label">Day +7 follow-up</div>
<pre>Hi {first_name},

Following up on the {month} invoice. It's now {n} days past due.

If something's going on (cash flow, business slowdown, anything),
reach out — I'd rather know and work something out than chase. If
it's just admin, the link below resolves it in 30 sec:

{stripe_link}

— Jon</pre>
</div>

<div class="sop-template">
  <div class="sop-template-label">Day +15 hold notice</div>
<pre>Hi {first_name},

Touching base: the {month} invoice is {n} days past due. Per our
service agreement, content updates and support pause on day 30 if
not resolved. Site stays up regardless.

If there's a hardship, tell me and I will work something out (split
the bill, push the cycle out, whatever makes sense). If it's just an
oversight, the link below resolves it:

{stripe_link}

If I don't hear back this week, I'll call. That's the next step.

— Jon</pre>
</div>

<h2>Phase 12 &middot; Offboarding</h2>

<div class="sop-template">
